Falsifies `designware_mobile_storage::proofs::each_bring_up_command_goes_to_a_card_state_that_accepts_it`.

The defect: `CMD7` carries the relative card address in the low half of its argument instead of
bits 31:16, so it selects address zero, which deselects every card, rather than the card that
answered `CMD3`.

Expected to fail: `assert!(card.illegal_commands == 0)`.
diff --git a/crates/designware_mobile_storage/src/sd.rs b/crates/designware_mobile_storage/src/sd.rs
--- a/crates/designware_mobile_storage/src/sd.rs
+++ b/crates/designware_mobile_storage/src/sd.rs
@@ -343,7 +343,7 @@
     let r1 = host
         .send_command(&Command::new(
             command::SELECT_CARD,
-            u32::from(relative_card_address) << 16,
+            u32::from(relative_card_address),
             Response::R1b,
         ))
         .map_err(|e| InitializationError::Identify(command::SELECT_CARD, e))?;
